WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.603
-White House Press Secretary,
Sarah Huckabee Sanders,

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.005
has been holding a lot
of press briefings lately.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:08.508
But I don't think all
the questions we need answered

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.909
have been asked.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:12.345
So we decided to hold another
one right here, right now.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.481
That's right,
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:15.614
and the "Late Night" press corps

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:17.950
are here in our studio
and ready to go.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.787
So without further ado,
it's time for the "Late Night"

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.189
White House Press Briefing.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.124
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:30.230 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:34.200
Sarah? Sarah, yes, Sarah. Sarah?
[ Reporters shouting at once ]

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.968
-Sarah. Yes, thank you.
Seth Meyers,

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.470
"Late Night with Seth Meyers."

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.107
Secretary Sanders, how would you
describe the Trump Presidency

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:44.511
in three words?
-Russia's unfortunate decision.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:47.180
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.314
-What does
the White House staff say

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:51.184
when Trump starts tweeting
on a Saturday?

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.418
-This will be
a working weekend.

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:55.622
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:58.525
-Donald Trump's approval rating
keeps spiraling to record lows,

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:00.560
with most polls showing it
below 40%.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.928
Do you think it
can fall any farther?

00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:05.031
-15% has been the goal.
It's always been the goal.

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:07.166
We're gonna continue
pushing for that.

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:08.935
-Best of luck.

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.870
What do you think
President Trump still needs

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.772
to learn in order to get better
at his job?

00:01:13.772 --> 00:01:15.008
-8th grade civics.
-Yeah.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.744
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:22.649
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.850
I heard you accidentally made
eye contact

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.821
with Ivanka Trump the other day.
How did that go?

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:29.322
-It seems like a kind face.

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:31.958
But when I looked at her again,
she spat on me.

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:38.731
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.100
-What role is
Eric Trump playing

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.502
within his father's
administration?

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:43.869
-He'll work with
the groundskeeping crew

00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:46.672
here at the White House
and will help cut the grass.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:49.442
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:52.779
-Secretary Sanders,
complete this Meatloaf lyric.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.247
I would do anything for love,
but --

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:56.916
-The President's not willing
to do that.

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.785
-Close.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.354
Very close.
How is Betsy DeVos doing

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:04.223
with learning the alphabet?
-There's a long way to go.

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:06.759
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:10.596
Is it true that Donald Trump
is considering

00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:15.267
the Mad Hatter to be the next
Federal Reserve Chairman?

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:18.004
-We're not gonna go down
rabbit holes on personnel.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:22.708
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:28.181
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:31.484
-What does Vice President
Mike Pence call sex?

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:32.719
-The Privacy Act.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:36.322
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.824
-Do you think Satan exists?

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:40.960
-He wrote the President
a letter earlier this year.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:46.132
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:48.000
-Has the President's stance
changed

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.903
on what his favorite
Pink Floyd album is?

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:52.871
-He's still 100% committed
to "The Wall."

00:02:52.871 --> 00:02:54.841
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:56.976
[ Applause ]

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:00.679
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.679 --> 00:03:04.417
What do you like better --
legs or feet?

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:05.451
-I think both of those parts

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.120
are very important
moving forward.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.656
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:12.725
- What was President Trump's
reaction to Ted Cruz

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:15.161
liking that porn video
on Twitter?

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:19.165
-He watched the entire thing.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.901
-Ted Cruz denies that he was
the one who liked that video.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:25.671
So if it wasn't him, what kind
of porn<i> does</i> he like?

00:03:25.671 --> 00:03:28.007
-A lot of strong women
in various positions.

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:35.248
[ Laughter and cheers ]

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.816
-How would you describe
Jared Kushner

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:38.918
in seven words or less?

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:40.620
-Inspiring 11-year-old
young man.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.254
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.254 --> 00:03:44.390
-What do people need
in order to realize

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.726
that the President is unhinged?

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:48.361
-Access to a working phone.

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:50.029
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:51.364
-What's the sentence

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:54.133
that terrifies President Trump
the most?

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:57.503
-Let's get to work.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.503 --> 00:04:00.105
-Follow up -- what's the biggest
thing you have in common

00:04:00.105 --> 00:04:02.641
with your predecessor,
Sean Spicer?

00:04:02.641 --> 00:04:04.577
-I hate to do this.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:07.213
[ Laughter ]
And finally, a question

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:09.982
that I
and I assume my colleagues

00:04:09.982 --> 00:04:11.817
have been dying to ask.

00:04:11.817 --> 00:04:13.920
How does an orgy work?

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.654
-As I've said several times
earlier today,

00:04:15.654 --> 00:04:18.224
the goal is to have everybody
come together.

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:21.494
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:24.797
-I told you. I told you guys.
I told you.

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:25.931
Well, it looks like
we're out of time.

00:04:25.931 --> 00:04:27.433
So on behalf of the rest
of the press corps,

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:28.801
have a good night.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:31.070
We'll be right back
with Kyra Sedgwick, everybody.

